        {"name": "micron::math::symbolic::expression", "header": "math/symbolic.hpp", "summary": "Move-only arena owner with a selected root ID.", "sections": [{"title": "Lifetime", "paragraphs": ["Default construction is invalid without allocating a normal arena. Construction from arena&& and root transfers storage without validating the root first; valid() checks that the root resolves. owner() returns a const borrowed arena reference and root() returns its local index. clone_to deeply duplicates all owned arena state and preserves the root ID. write_csexp delegates to the owner. Returned node/name/coefficient views do not retain this owner."]}]},
        {"name": "micron::math::symbolic::limits", "header": "math/symbolic.hpp", "summary": "Capacity and work limits for nodes, symbols, text, depth, rewrites, polynomial degree, and rational limb/exponent operations.", "sections": [{"title": "Defaults and validation", "paragraphs": ["Defaults are 65536 nodes, 4096 symbols, 1048576 text bytes, depth 256, 131072 rewrite steps, and polynomial degree 256, plus rational_limits defaults. Construction requires positive principal capacities, nodes at most 2^28, depth at most 512, polynomial degree at most 4096, and compatible rational work limits. These are resource/work budgets, not an accuracy tolerance. Reaching a limit is reported in the operation result."]}]},
